{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-30T16:52:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-30T22:22:25+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-30T22:22:29+05:30\nThe search for \"\"gta5-mods.com\" \"Spider-Man\" OR \"mega ramp\" OR \"Menyoo\"\" returned the following summary:\nAt **GTA5-Mods.com**, you can find a wide variety of mods related to Spider-Man, mega ramps, and the Menyoo trainer. Here is a summary of what is available:\n\n### **Spider-Man Mods**\nThere are numerous mods allowing you to play as Spider-Man or add related content to the game:\n*   **Spider-Man V [.NET]:** A highly popular script mod (by sollaholla & jedijosh920) that allows you to experience Spider-Man’s abilities in GTA 5[1].\n*   **Skin/Model Packs:** Various add-on ped mods are available, including the **Spider-Man Trilogy Pack**[2], **Spider-Man (Civil War/Homecoming)**[3][4], and the **Spider-Man Pack** featuring suits from *Far From Home* and *Infinity War*[5][6].\n*   **Webbing Mods:** You can also find add-ons like \"Spider-Man Webs,\" which replace rope models to enhance the experience of existing Spider-Man script mods[7].\n\n### **Mega Ramp Mods**\nThere is a massive selection of \"Mega Ramp\" maps designed for stunts and racing. These are typically provided as XML files that require a trainer (like Menyoo) to load[8][9]:\n*   **Popular Options:** You will find many variations such as the *Impossible Mega Ramp Challenge*[10][11], *Ultra Ramp*[12], *Double Mega Ramp*[12][13], and *ICE MEGA RAMP Challenge*[13].\n*   **Installation:** Most of these map mods require you to place an `.xml` file into your `menyooStuff\\Spooner` folder and load them in-game via the Menyoo \"Object Spooner\" menu[8][9][14].\n\n### **Menyoo Trainer**\nMenyoo is a powerful, widely-used GUI trainer for GTA 5[15].\n*   **Functionality:** It allows for object spawning, map loading (as seen with the mega ramps), vehicle customization, and much more[8][15][16].\n*   **Updates:** You can find the latest version, **Menyoo 2.0 (Enhanced & Legacy)**, which is actively maintained to support current game patches[17].\n*   **Requirement Note:** Almost all map mods on the site require a legitimate, updated copy of GTA V and the latest version of ScriptHookV to function correctly[8][15][18].\n\nSources:\n[1] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFnmq7QiLZvZdxnlK-FytZxfk2Rcy4U4s4R4qX5F-qiGuZx4R6jf5Lx7Fi51xOF1yy6x4sTSD8oVMsNa4E4nKWFrOZ-qME8WFHTCgqyJG0rqOTS-as804LLke61IYWPjsOazqE2Pe2jiA==)\n[2] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEIUSpr_QkhVdXKmYFNE1hy65f_uYSyWQSwXojIw7nMlHms0NszOfgOePlQA0ZJ4h27NIj4VKc6SnyjZY07i7VSDb6iN2AkZUsUcCtr6fvqfa2Yjt_nD1KrralPdzH0iDYuubNZyIrpdos8otytMw==)\n[3] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFI5JO60rubrtNnL6tb5SS78W0ekAASsjollikgQA3x5lR78QZMVzvAxnXrg6abP2AUcChs3mjSXbKvesqQMo_sF46k3R2nz-CNIwlTfqX7p_2PFPl6QWSiuuIxcLf1rNEM5kzwXkngn8jvVGGJgJqNT8E=)\n[4] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEfp1yAnMVaBnWWvUkm_4IN4yLZfqEnijZPNPWLmzyhLdG4LbMhkG9mu6f4mJLCldl2R9wUHdtNUGH09WrqTjk2fqD-S_C6bQeWsR8W8xlw5HlITPixBj-COhvf0zZfG004qSShuJgKtgM8CfjFPhWaHiDStJ3frnKx3jAPIhE=)\n[5] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGeBaXkZG_FV-tOVSH0PDXHej_Gv8w-SgrCMxX8U8JyJc-1rlR3M-tc5TCFejBLj4KVo8-6IZMkE8VxKEOG_ySevKdWDwabhJ-7Y3iLrnIMrFHMIA2c77WyYQfbxjv9z3Jefj81mqqSWvOj_0R06Fwj_1GF79GnPBEUHA==)\n[6] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFUByx_NQxGg4kAt70vfj6cqcJgjVjcK7yQZ9p63JiXuhf_4fgpO9FTx6xkhM12u3vl_Szh68K9t9Bu-TThJy_cEi0XDoJa9uKyWT-B5Dq-agoLW353BRANYkaGiH0TcpHk6qxbns_f3rOVq7PLOIHUNAlQqcnbWOx_TTGYqXvEkFEE_oA=)\n[7] [gta5-mods.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_lFJ_bvUhOduCx9VXzHa5fkJnyV7fuZceCVaRZ9P2Nek2h24-_axQQ5IOHMUp83MGYj45e-Avkr